/// STOCK-OPS-01：序列化资产状态变更追加账。订单、归还处置和资料维护共用这一张历史表。
model RentalAssetStatusHistory {
  id          String            @id @default(uuid())
  tenantId    String
  tenant      Tenant            @relation(fields: [tenantId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  workspaceId String
  workspace   BusinessWorkspace @relation(fields: [tenantId, workspaceId], references: [tenantId, id], onDelete: Cascade)
  assetId     String
  asset       RentalAsset       @relation(fields: [assetId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  assetNo     String            @db.VarChar(191)
  fromStatus  RentalAssetState?
  toStatus    RentalAssetState
  source      String            @db.VarChar(24)
  sourceId    String?           @db.VarChar(191)
  reason      String            @db.VarChar(500)
  operator    String            @db.VarChar(191)
